            "review_title": "Review at Con Ga Trong Garden",
            "review_text": "André S\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam52 contributions\n0\nA leafy atmosphere\nJan 2019 • Friends\nWe came in a group of 7 to enjoy our very last meal of the year 2018. The restaurant was full, it is surprisingly spacious and adaptative with its multi level configuration. You can either go public, garden, quiet or even select a more bushy leafy decor.\n\nWe choose a variety of plates that we all shared together along with several beers.\nEvery plateau were tasteful and delicious, they really master the art of cuisine.\n\nThe service was also at the rendez vous, they have an army of personnel.\nWe ended up saying mot hay ba gio several times (cheers in vietnam), laughed a lot so did most of the other groups. Celebration was in the air.\nAt the end of the evening we were somewhat expecting the total, and only paid about 13 usd per person!!!!\nWow come again.\nA very top rated leafy recommandation they deserve.\nThank you.\nRead more\nWritten January 2, 2019",
