            "review_title": "Review at Con Ga Trong Garden",
            "review_text": "Nhu_Phuong\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam292 contributions\n0\nFair food and fair price\nDec 2016 • Business\nI would say for the location of the restaurant, the price is quite fair. Even though I dined here with people from work, I think this is a great place for families. The place is very spacious, which is great for children to run around. I was just there yesterday and since it's close to Christmas, the decoration was quite festive, I think kids would love it. Staff is alright, not extremely professional but professional enough not to annoy diners, good manners, quick and sufficient. Good enough for me! \n\nFood is good. I had some of the signature dishes: fried rice with dried fish, deep fried fish, stir-fried mushroom (very nice!), mango salad with shrimp, etc. All was good!\n\nI would recommend this place for business lunch/dinner, office party or family dinning.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 16, 2016",
